{
  "title": "克莱恩 · 中子流溢区 · 监听频道",
  "titleKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.title",
  "startDelay": 3,
  "steps": [
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "你们已经多次无视我们的警告。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.01.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 6.378
    },
    {
      "team": "sharded",
      "speaker": "Sharded",
      "text": "所以呢？",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.02.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.sharded",
      "duration": 4.837
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "我们已经授权在该区域使用核武器。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.03.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 7.212
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "立即停止一切军事行动，并撤出中子流溢区。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.04.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 8.403
    },
    {
      "team": "sharded",
      "speaker": "Sharded",
      "text": "你们可以试试。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.05.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.sharded",
      "duration": 5.628
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "……",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.06.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 4.795
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "看来你们仍然没有意识到局势的严重性。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.06.02",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 7.42
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "最后通牒。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.07.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 5.628
    },
    {
      "team": "crux",
      "speaker": "Crux",
      "text": "立即撤离，否则我们将启动核打击程序。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.07.02",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.crux",
      "duration": 7.587
    },
    {
      "team": "sharded",
      "speaker": "Sharded",
      "text": "通讯结束。",
      "textKey": "cryon.radio.story.neutron-flux-zone.08.01",
      "speakerKey": "cryon.radio.speaker.sharded",
      "duration": 5.462
    }
  ]
}
